DevOps Technical Screening Experience 

 DevOps technical screening interview focused on AWS, Kubernetes, Terraform, CI/CD, production support, and real-world troubleshooting scenarios.

Sharing some of the questions that were asked during the discussion — these were more scenario and experience-oriented rather than purely theoretical.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

1. Introduction / Background
• Can you describe your professional background and highlight the experiences most relevant to this role?

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

2. Project / Hands-on Experience
• Can you walk us through a specific project where you designed and implemented a CI/CD pipeline?
• What challenges did you face, and how did you address them?

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

3. Problem-Solving / Real Scenario
• Tell me about a time you faced a significant challenge at work. How did you handle it?

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

4. Prioritization / Work Management
• How do you prioritize your work when you have multiple tasks or deadlines?

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

5. Behavioral Deep Dive (Follow-up)
• Can you give a specific situation where you had several tasks at once?
• How did you handle priorities like a production issue and deployment at the same time?

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

6. Security & Compliance (Advanced DevOps)
• How do you ensure compliance with security standards and audit requirements in regulated environments?

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

7. Career Goals / Culture Fit
• Where do you see yourself in the next few years, and how does this role fit into your goals?
